     finish-to-finish, start-to-finish) with lags and a lead in working days, Start No Earlier
     Than, Start No Later Than, Must Start On, Must Finish On and Finish No Later Than constraints,
     a deadline, milestones, a link from a summary task, and a project calendar with lunch breaks,
     two non-working holidays and a working Saturday morning.

