     published scheduling rules, worked by hand (the calendar: Monday to Friday 08:00 to 12:00 and
     13:00 to 17:00; Monday 4 May and Monday 25 May 2026 off; Saturday 16 May 2026 worked 08:00 to
     12:00; a day is 8 hours):

